        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports approximately 3 kg weight loss over approximately 6 months; pants are looser. Weight was noted to be decreased compared with the last visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Body mass index"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Approximately 22 today; last BMI was 23.5 approximately 9 months ago."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Difficulty preparing meals and cooking"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For the last 2–3 months, increasingly troubled by meals; forgets pots on the stove and reports leaving the gas on twice, becomes confused with recipes and appliances, and often skips lunch because making something is too difficult. Often eats toast, biscuits, or cereal; daughter brings some pre-prepared meals."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neurological symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No sudden weakness, facial droop, speech change, or vision change reported. No recent falls. Reports feeling a bit wobbly when rushing in the kitchen."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood and behavioral symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies persistent low mood. No hallucinations or behavioral and psychological symptoms of dementia reported; some repetitive questions and anxiety."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance and behavior"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Thin, well groomed, anxious but cooperative."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Orientation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert and oriented to person and place; partially oriented to time, knowing month and year only."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Cranial nerves grossly intact, no focal deficit, power 5/5 in all limbs, gait slow but steady, and no parkinsonism."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Brief cognitive assessment"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Three-word registration intact; recall 1/3 at 5 minutes with cue. Poor clock drawing with crowded numbers and hands off. Follows two-step instructions and struggles with three-step instructions. Similar to prior notes."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
